      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "5b98c89afb611e642450140a",
      "mergedPostDetails": "As it stands if the battery's in your  Vive wands/Oculus touch controllers (or the upcoming Vive wireless adapter) run out you have to quit out of VRChat and reboot it to switch to Desktop mode witch can hold up game's or ruin the fun you were having because you didn't keep track of which instance you were in.",
