      "postID": "58c630d35865713647a71164",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In desktop mode we can run several applications and switch between many windows: internet browser, file manager, notes, and so on. We can copy link from browser and insert it to the VR-theater in VRChat. We can play VRChat and find information in the internet at the same time and discuss this information with VRC-friends. So we've got a lot of possibilities in desktop mode and we don't have it using VR. We need \"Desktop in VR\" mode when we see screen of monitor in VR and able to control our desktop: run applications, switching between windows, copy and paste text, software keyboard, voice input, and so on. We need full control of desktop in VR without having to remove the helmet.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
